    questionText: "Using the information provided above calculate the following: (a) Total Revenue at forecasted output, (b) Total Costs of Production at forecasted output, (c) Profit at forecasted output, (d) Breakeven point (BEP) in units (It is not necessary to draw a breakeven chart).",
